Let's get liquored up.

265
00:30:24.001 --> 00:30:25.284
Cheers.

266
00:30:27.834 --> 00:30:30.168
The kindergarten fee is enough?

267
00:30:42.101 --> 00:30:43.484
You coming?

268
00:30:44.876 --> 00:30:47.376
