269
00:30:54.618 --> 00:30:55.626
Yeah.

270
00:30:55.834 --> 00:30:59.276
- Right. We do this first?
- I'm serious.

271
00:30:59.793 --> 00:31:02.509
Why else you think
we were flirting with you?

272
00:31:05.209 --> 00:31:07.268
Out of Nanking, how?

273
00:31:08.126 --> 00:31:09.693
I don't know how,

274
00:31:09.793 --> 00:31:12.818
but I know your face is
the way out of here.

275
00:31:12.834 --> 00:31:15.676
The Japanese won't touch Westerners.

276
00:31:16.209 --> 00:31:19.043
Did you see it out there?
That's not happening.

277
00:31:21.459 --> 00:31:22.559
No.

278
00:31:23.126 --> 00:31:23.959
Cash enough?

279
00:31:24.793 --> 00:31:26.534
Cause... let's...

280
00:31:38.143 --> 00:31:40.101
Are you kidding?

281
00:31:40.126 --> 00:31:41.584
Wait, wait, wait...

282
00:31:41.651 --> 00:31:43.876
Let's work this out. Let's work it out.

283
00:31:44.543 --> 00:31:47.459
Think about it.
If you help us,

284
00:31:47.668 --> 00:31:51.518
