- Don't.

344
00:38:45.043 --> 00:38:47.643
And thy gams, and thy chest...

345
00:38:47.709 --> 00:38:49.284
Stop it!

346
00:38:50.418 --> 00:38:52.393
- Stop it!
- I gotta...

347
00:38:52.484 --> 00:38:55.459
Stop it, damn it,
you drunk bastard!

348
00:38:58.359 --> 00:39:01.193
This is a house of love not war,
