354
00:39:22.943 --> 00:39:24.551
You're such a fool!

355
00:39:24.559 --> 00:39:26.601
If it wasn't for your foreign face...

356
00:39:26.668 --> 00:39:29.051
- I like it when you're angry.
...I wouldn't even look at you!

357
00:39:29.059 --> 00:39:29.926
Harder.

358
00:39:29.959 --> 00:39:32.026
