Search everywhere!

411
00:44:33.276 --> 00:44:35.059
Capture them alive!

412
00:46:00.501 --> 00:46:03.443
Lieutenant Asakura!
Come up here!

413
00:46:03.584 --> 00:46:05.476
We've got virgins!

414
00:46:05.518 --> 00:46:06.826
Hurry!

415
00:46:07.543 --> 00:46:08.676
Stop!

416
00:46:10.101 --> 00:46:11.726
Girls! Girls!

417
00:47:02.359 --> 00:47:03.434
Stop!

418
00:47:04.501 --> 00:47:05.534
Stop!

419
00:47:06.684 --> 00:47:07.718
Stop!

420
00:47:08.459 --> 00:47:10.809
This is a house of the Lord!

421
00:47:10.851 --> 00:47:12.526
